$ CONM2 with offset and products of inertia in a rotated CID (5), on a grid with rotated CP and CD (7), PARAM GRDPNT 0.
$ Check: MGG at grid 1 = exact (offset and tensor rotated to basic, parallel axis, rotated to CD 7), and the GPWG
$ inertia about the origin = exact; see conm2_mass_check.py.
SOL 103
OUTPUT4 MGG,,,,//-1/21
CEND
METHOD = 1
BEGIN BULK
PARAM,GRDPNT,0
CORD2R,5,,0.,0.,0.,0.3,0.4,0.866,+C5
+C5,1.,0.2,0.1
CORD2R,7,,1.,2.,3.,1.2,1.9,4.,+C7
+C7,2.,2.5,3.1
GRID,1,7,2.,-1.,0.5,7
GRID,2,,10.,0.,0.,,123456
CBAR,1,1,1,2,0.,0.,1.
PBAR,1,1,1.,1.,1.,1.
MAT1,1,1.E6,,0.3
CONM2,4501,1,5,10.,1.5,-2.,0.7,,+M1
+M1,5.,0.8,7.,-0.6,1.1,9.
EIGRL,1,,,3
ENDDATA
